hUKEwjrsrXm99mWAxXXGDQIHTxwMMgQ3YcHCLQBKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjrsrXm99mWAxXXGDQIHTxwMMgQ3IcHCLMBKA8",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["位於市府轉運站附近的鷹流臺灣總店，當初看到這家店每碗拉麵竟然要賣將近500元，就過來看看，這家的拉麵都有加牛肉，因此不能吃牛的要注意一下。\n這次嘗試的是「超極濃湯2929牛肉麵」，超極濃湯2929牛肉麵售價500元，有醬油或鹽味兩種口味可以選，因為本人比較喜歡吃鹹一點的拉麵，所以這次嘗試醬油口味，拉麵上面放滿了牛肉，並且加了一顆生蛋、些許蒜頭及四季豆等，視覺效果十分不錯，吃之前可以將生蛋攪破沾著牛肉吃，口感會更好，拉麵本身頭湯夠濃，非常的讚👍，吃到一半可以咬一下拉麵裡的蒜頭或四季豆解膩，或者店內的調味料，如果你是跟我一樣喜歡吃牛肉且喜歡濃湯拉麵的人，一定會喜歡這家店，雖然價格偏貴，但是值得吃吃看。\n\n2026/2/20",null,[0,69]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10469682739376971649/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrV0dRd01WbFpNMlIxVFZkNGNXVkdiRzlqYkVadlVtNXJlRlZIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10469682739376971649/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrV0dRd01WbFpNMlIxVFZkNGNXVkdiRzlqYkVadlVtNXJlRlZIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10469682739376971649/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrV0dRd01WbFpNMlIxVFZkNGNXVkdiRzlqYkVadlVtNXJlRlZIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10469682739376971649/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrV0dRd01WbFpNMlIxVFZkNGNXVkdiRzlqYkVadlVtNXJlRlZIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10469682739376971649/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrV0dRd01WbFpNMlIxVFZkNGNXVkdiRzlqYkVadlVtNXJlRlZIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10469682739376971649/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrV0dRd01WbFpNMlIxVFZkNGNXVkdiRzlqYkVadlVtNXJlRlZIWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,12949,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkWGQwMVlZM2R1TVd4cWVGbG9jbEZvUm5reFVHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7d0bcf29b394ab08!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjdXd01YY3duMWxqeFloclFoRnkxUGc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local